[{"title":"题孙氏画梅","author":"周瑛","text":"孙姬可是梅花精，梅花写出浑天成。\n香魂不逐水云起，老干绝似冰霜清。\n草堂夜深净如洗，月色朦胧照凄楚。\n哜嘈鸟语酒初醒，呜咽角声天未曙。\n闺门作画世应稀，何不改学周南诗。\n关雎麟趾亦图画，画出周家王化基。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李长者入祀典歌","author":"周瑛","text":"仙溪诘曲如回肠，东流赴海何茫茫。\n凭谁截断天地纪，灌我万顷桑麻场。\n钱氏四娘长乐女，黄金如斗提不起。\n将军岩下自经营，陂溃直随此陂死。\n伟哉同县林制科，缗钱十万腰下驮。\n温泉隘口重累趾，倏忽顾盼成沧波。\n熙宁天子重农事，下诏募人急营治。\n当时阖郡多富家，坐视诏书无一至。\n候官长者真仁贤，轻财好施闽人传。\n有僧踪迹颇诡秘，日日贳酒不还钱。\n木兰山前溪面阔，僧为插竹记颠末。\n溪流缓处可立基，缓处立基基不拔。\n入海伐石海为空，上山伐石山为童。\n三十二门细分布，无云无雨卧长虹。\n昔日溪流皆赴海，今日溪流得灌溉。\n鸡鸣犬吠万家村，隐隐桑麻相映带。\n我谓有莆须有陂，有莆无陂莆亦隳。\n惟莆与陂相终始，莆人思公何尽期。\n昨日恩诏下闾里，春秋二祭入新议。\n借问建言者伊谁，太平郡守周氏子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题湛庵为戴陈州作","author":"周瑛","text":"此庵有佳士，物我两相忘。\n人世红炉热，渠心秋水凉。\n绮罗无弄著，藜藿有馀香。\n晚路行犹远，烦君更自防。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访仙游郑东园和翰林诸公留别韵","author":"周瑛","text":"赐告下蓬莱，山居亦乐哉。\n开窗邀翠巘，扫石护苍苔。\n冗泛谢尘事，清夷养道胎。\n学充还出去，鸾阁正需才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邵武道中夜宿半山铺","author":"周瑛","text":"邵武城头路，行行重苦辛。\n高山双倦足，空馆一愁人。\n凉月照华发，西风吹敝巾。\n长安一万里，何处问通津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明节寄诸弟","author":"周瑛","text":"疏雨清明节，客中思不禁。\n荒山一抔土，孝子百年心。\n竟岁身南北，终天悲古今。\n荐蘩托诸弟，挥涕满衣襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题慈节卷为萧给事赋","author":"周瑛","text":"内则读遗篇，持循自昔年。\n从夫念一醮，教子学三迁。\n络纬秋灯馆，钗钿晓爨烟。\n平生慈与节，太史费摩编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送友人丘安重知瑞安县","author":"周瑛","text":"论交三十载，此日叹分离。\n海阔飞凫迥，云深过雁迟。\n近民宜直易，作事贵操持。\n莫以纤毫累，翻为负所知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陈公甫神乐观夜坐韵","author":"周瑛","text":"虫声秋院静，木榻自来凭。\n细数千年事，閒挑五夜灯。\n子房真学道，王旦谩为僧。\n湖水渺无际，寒鱼不受罾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题谢侍御乃兄石溜鸣琴图","author":"周瑛","text":"幽人结屋处，石溜响潺潺。\n桐木不须削，梅花能自弹。\n鹤鸣山月小，鱼跃水天寒。\n安得脱尘屣，从君坐夜阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到广德作东园书室","author":"周瑛","text":"东园有馀地，可以作书斋。\n千古圣贤学，百年经济怀。\n庭松云外鹤，池草雨中蛙。\n五色石堪炼，吾将师女娲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西坛即事","author":"周瑛","text":"夜半坛头路，露华寒袭衣。\n树深灯影乱，野旷佩声稀。\n精意无人会，丰年祗自祈。\n周家声教远，幽雅更重吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云寺午炊","author":"周瑛","text":"楼阁四檐合，松萝一径分。\n微风传夕磬，疏雨引朝薰。\n人世几沧海，青山自白云。\n午炊犹未熟，驺从复纷纷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南湖夜发","author":"周瑛","text":"扁舟发初夜，渺渺入平湖。\n水满天上下，云深山有无。\n琴声人共远，灯影客同孤。\n借问柏台树，春鸣何处乌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"世美堂为戴提学侍御作","author":"周瑛","text":"世美堂前事，人间能几何。\n一门三执法，二世十登科。\n袍笏床头满，勋名宇内多。\n晓来看山色，佳气正峨峨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自题画像","author":"周瑛","text":"对此丹青笔，今吾始识吾。\n秋江片石瘦，冬岭一松孤。\n不是庙堂器，真成草泽癯。\n行当返初服，归以读吾书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山亭晚坐","author":"周瑛","text":"独坐山亭晚，萧然一径开。\n雨声惊醉梦，山色护诗胎。\n爱静应逃俗，养高成废材。\n城闉才咫尺，未许世人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自警告诸僚友","author":"周瑛","text":"脚下程途远，镜中毛发丝。\n治狂须止酒，医瘦莫吟诗。\n勿谓性多僻，须知圣可师。\n忍将锦绣段，白日弃泥淄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书满南归同年屠元勋邀李西涯诸公十有二人饯别分韵赋诗予得鱼字","author":"周瑛","text":"湖海多年别，衣冠此夜俱。\n可因同绿醑，更复唱骊驹。\n去路青山外，层城白雪初。\n他时相慰问，万里只双鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜渡淮河望西湖嘴作","author":"周瑛","text":"孤舟发深夜，归路属残秋。\n野旷星辰近，江空霜月浮。\n得风帆力劲，顺水橹声柔。\n遥望西湖嘴，青灯映小楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦中赋登金山寺","author":"周瑛","text":"高阁逼霄汉，客边望眼开。\n雁将秋色去，潮带夕阳回。\n天地双蓬鬓，兴亡一酒杯。\n此怀不可极，倚槛独徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过苏州与丘时雍李应祯夜话","author":"周瑛","text":"今夕是何夕，长歌朋盍簪。\n参商照天角，风雪满山阴。\n衣袂秋阴薄，帘栊烛影深。\n情长嫌夜短，一刻比千金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑孰道中","author":"周瑛","text":"采石孤帆落，青山一骑归。\n朔风吹短鬓，疏雨湿征衣。\n野火渔归市，林钟僧掩扉。\n可怜江上雁，入夜更南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日建平道中","author":"周瑛","text":"天时早晚异，地气夏秋同。\n雨脚青山外，雷声白日中。\n马饥频啮勒，人乏半扶筇。\n薄暮到城郭，月华生树东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜和贾汝阳韵","author":"周瑛","text":"独坐不成寐，夜深天欲霜。\n炉薰生细缕，灯晕结寒光。\n世事鬓毛短，客怀更漏长。\n引杯聊自酌，非是为诗狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横山与吴水部晚酌","author":"周瑛","text":"公馀幽兴发，并辔入林峦。\n云暝鸟将尽，雨深僧未还。\n檐花落郑馆，野韭荐苏盘。\n水部原能赋，令人屡解颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47789,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵酬蒋宗谊节推见寄二首 其一","author":"周瑛","text":"蒋君年最少，真是谪仙人。\n才美应无敌，诗成若有神。\n玉堂曾借稿，紫府剩留春。\n虞网何时下，东山有凤麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47790,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵酬蒋宗谊节推见寄二首 其二","author":"周瑛","text":"别君未数载，倏忽将衰人。\n学未究天地，行多惭鬼神。\n徘徊海上梦，寂寞江南春。\n况闻左车子，西狩踣祥麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47791,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横山燕集二首 其一","author":"周瑛","text":"小瓮藏天地，大杯挥古今。\n宦情秋梦短，世事海波深。\n北枕渊明卧，南耕梁父吟。\n官卑多抑畏，惭愧昔贤心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47792,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横山燕集二首 其二","author":"周瑛","text":"一鞭寒日里，吊古复伤今。\n鸟背秋阴薄，马头山色深。\n朱弦方断绝，白屋正呻吟。\n安得范司理，同摅经济心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47793,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与陈贰守酌别","author":"周瑛","text":"下马何村庙，霜清木落时。\n行人千里去，故国一年期。\n水色照衣袖，山光落酒卮。\n离怀难尽遣，惆怅为题诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47794,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新岁枕上作","author":"周瑛","text":"读书三十载，此日得为州。\n世路行来险，官居轻若浮。\n名高思自抑，福浅戒深求。\n天道有盈歇，吾心当熟谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47795,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春山中风雪如腊","author":"周瑛","text":"春光怜欲尽，气候未全平。\n屋霰激寒响，檐风吹朔声。\n蚕登何处箔，牛废此时耕。\n岁计知无赖，凭谁达圣明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47796,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石溪寺二首 其一","author":"周瑛","text":"细数头陀路，萦纡十八盘。\n外疑无处入，中觉有馀宽。\n猛水擘山出，奔云拿石还。\n谁能谢尘鞅，来此共盘桓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47797,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游石溪寺二首 其二","author":"周瑛","text":"四面峰峦合，有僧深处居。\n旧庐甲乙在，废殿丙丁馀。\n水色侵衣桁，山光入钵盂。\n小诗吟未就，斜日满轩车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47798,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入宣州","author":"周瑛","text":"落日满宣州，马头春事幽。\n山佳多入郭，潮涨欲平畴。\n戛竹农惊鹿，吹芦僮牧牛。\n澄江与叠嶂，掩映谢公楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47799,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出郭","author":"周瑛","text":"骑马出东郭，茅檐遍拊循。\n吏需宁复急，民俗可曾淳。\n箫鼓云中社，桑麻雨后村。\n汉家循吏传，原不录刘昆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47800,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归舟至毗陵阻冻怀老母在官所作","author":"周瑛","text":"一上归舟日，便为见母期。\n谁知咫尺地，翻作逗遛悲。\n冰合河流断，雪深山路危。\n高堂念游子，正是倚门时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47801,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣州夜坐阅公案有作二首 其一","author":"周瑛","text":"少学屠龙技，晚收劾鼠名。\n深情数日辨，弊牍几番更。\n自古雀无角，方今蝇善鸣。\n就中生死路，不敢负神明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":47802,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣州夜坐阅公案有作二首 其二","author":"周瑛","text":"邹公述仁义，申子说刑名。\n俯仰人千古，徘徊夜二更。\n灯寒花不结，窗破纸常鸣。\n听尽阶前雨，东方未肯明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","po